        "title_paragraph_spacing": 20,
        "title_paragraph_spacing_mob": 20,
        "paragraph": "<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> 10,1, 2026</p><p>Welcome to Luxe Sassy. These Terms of Service (\"Terms\") govern your use of [<a href=\"http://www.luxesassy.com\">www.luxesassy.com</a>] (the \"Site\") and any purchase you make from us. The Site is operated by [Luxe Sassy LLC] (\"Luxe Sassy,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\").</p><p>By accessing the Site or placing an order, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site or make a purchase.</p><p>We may update these Terms at any time. Changes take effect when posted on this page, and the \"Last Updated\" date above will reflect the latest revision. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted means you accept the updated Terms.</p><h3>1. Your Account</h3><p>You may create an account to track orders, save your details, and check out faster. You agree to:</p><ul><li>Provide accurate, current, and complete information, and keep it up to date</li><li>Keep your login details confidential and not share or transfer your account</li><li>Take responsibility for all activity under your account</li><li>Notify us right away at [<a href=\"mailto:support@luxesassy.com\">support@luxesassy.com</a>] if you suspect unauthorized access</li></ul><p>You must be at least 18 years old, or the age of majority where you live, to make a purchase. Please take care when signing in from a shared or public device.</p><h3>2. Products, Pricing, and Availability</h3><p>All products are subject to availability. We may limit quantities, decline or cancel any order (in whole or in part), or discontinue any product at any time without notice.</p><p>All prices are listed in U.S. dollars. Taxes and shipping charges are calculated at checkout and are added to your order total. Prices may change without notice, but the price shown at checkout is the price you pay for that order (subject to Section 7).</p><h3>3. Placing and Cancelling Orders</h3><p>When you place an order, you'll provide payment, shipping, and contact details. This information is handled as described in our [Privacy Policy]. You confirm that all information you provide is accurate and that you are authorized to use the payment method you submit.</p><p>An order confirmation email means we've received your order, not that it has been accepted. We may need to verify information before accepting an order.</p><p><strong>Cancellations:</strong> Because we process orders quickly, you may cancel only before your order has been processed for shipment. To request a cancellation, email [<a href=\"mailto:support@luxesassy.com\">support@luxesassy.com</a>] as soon as possible with your order number. Once an order has shipped, it can't be cancelled but may be eligible for return under Section 6.</p><h3>4. Payment</h3><p>We accept [Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, PayPal, Shop Pay, Apple Pay, and Google Pay]. Payments are processed securely through our third-party payment providers; we do not store full card details.</p><p>Please enter your billing address exactly as it appears on your card or payment account. Incorrect details may delay or prevent your order from being processed. Your payment method is charged when your order is placed.</p><h3>5. Shipping and Delivery</h3><p>We currently ship within the United States. Most orders are processed within [1–2] business days and typically arrive within [2–5] business days after shipping. Delivery estimates shown at checkout or in emails are estimates only and are not guaranteed.</p><p>Please note:</p><ul><li>Items in the same order may ship from different U.S. fulfillment centers and arrive in separate packages.</li><li>If an item is delayed or unavailable, we'll let you know and give you the option to wait or receive a refund for that item.</li><li>You'll receive tracking information by email once your order ships.</li><li>Shipping charges are shown at checkout. We may change our shipping rates at any time, but any change will be shown before you complete a purchase.</li></ul><p>Risk of loss passes to you once the carrier marks your order as delivered to the address you provided. If your tracking shows delivered but you haven't received your package, contact us within [7] days and we'll help you file a claim with the carrier. We are not responsible for orders delivered to an incorrect address entered at checkout.</p><h3>6. Returns, Exchanges, and Refunds</h3><p>We want you to love your purchase. If something isn't right, you may request a return within <strong>[14] days of delivery</strong>, subject to these conditions:</p><ul><li>Items must be unworn, unwashed, and in original condition with all tags and packaging.</li><li>For hygiene reasons, <strong>earrings, body jewelry, and [intimates/swimwear]</strong> are final sale unless they arrive damaged or defective.</li><li>Items marked <strong>Final Sale</strong> or purchased on clearance cannot be returned.</li></ul><p><strong>How to start a return:</strong> Email [<a href=\"mailto:support@luxesassy.com\">support@luxesassy.com</a>] with your order number and the item(s) you'd like to return. We'll reply with return instructions and the correct return address. Items sent without an approved return request, or to an address other than the one we provide, may not be accepted.</p><p><strong>Refunds:</strong> Once your return is received and inspected, we'll email you to confirm approval. Approved refunds are issued to your original payment method within [5–10] business days; your bank or card issuer may take additional time to post it. Original shipping charges are non-refundable, and return shipping is the customer's responsibility unless the item arrived damaged, defective, or incorrect.</p><p><strong>Damaged, defective, or wrong items:</strong> Contact us within [7] days of delivery with your order number and photos of the item and packaging. We'll send a replacement or issue a full refund, including shipping.</p><p><strong>Exchanges:</strong> The fastest way to get a different size or color is to return the original item for a refund and place a new order.</p><h3>7. Errors and Inaccuracies</h3><p>We work to keep product descriptions, pricing, and availability accurate, but errors can happen. We do not guarantee that all information on the Site is complete, current, or error-free. If we discover an error, including a pricing error, we may correct it and either contact you to confirm the corrected order or cancel it and refund any amount charged.</p><h3>8. Product Images and Descriptions</h3><p>We aim to show our products as accurately as possible. However, colors may vary slightly depending on your screen settings, and some images may be enlarged to show detail. Jewelry measurements and materials are listed in each product description; please review them before purchasing. Minor variations in finish, stone, or color are normal and are not considered defects.</p><h3>9. Disclaimer of Warranties and Limitation of Liability</h3><p>The Site and all products and content are provided \"as is\" and \"as available,\" without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement, except as required by law.</p><p>TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, LUXE SASSY AND ITS OWNERS, MEMBERS, EMPLOYEES, AGENTS, SUPPLIERS, AND AFFILIATES WILL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR LOST PROFITS, ARISING FROM (I) THESE TERMS, (II) YOUR USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THE SITE, OR (III) ANY PRODUCT PURCHASED THROUGH THE SITE, EVEN IF WE HAVE BEEN ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES. OUR TOTAL LIABILITY FOR ANY CLAIM WILL NOT EXCEED THE AMOUNT YOU PAID FOR THE PRODUCT(S) GIVING RISE TO THE CLAIM.</p><p>Some states do not allow certain limitations, so some of the above may not apply to you.</p><h3>10. Indemnification</h3><p>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Luxe Sassy and its owners, members, employees, agents, and affiliates from any claims, losses, damages, liabilities, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys' fees) arising from your breach of these Terms or your misuse of the Site.</p><h3>11. Intellectual Property</h3><p>All content on the Site, including text, graphics, logos, product photos, and designs, is owned by or licensed to Luxe Sassy and is protected by U.S. and international copyright and trademark laws. You may not copy, reproduce, modify, distribute, or use any content without our prior written permission.</p><h3>12. Acceptable Use</h3><p>You agree not to use the Site for any unlawful purpose, to interfere with its operation, to attempt unauthorized access to any part of it, to use bots or scrapers, or to place fraudulent orders. We may cancel orders or suspend accounts involved in suspected fraud or misuse.</p><h3>13. Governing Law</h3><p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of [State of LLC registration], without regard to conflict-of-law rules. The Site is intended for users in the United States, and we make no claim that it is appropriate for use elsewhere.</p><h3>14. Dispute Resolution and Arbitration</h3><p>Please contact us first at [<a href=\"mailto:support@luxesassy.com\">support@luxesassy.com</a>]; most concerns can be resolved quickly and informally.</p><p>If a dispute cannot be resolved informally within 30 days, it will be resolved by binding individual arbitration administered by the American Arbitration Association (AAA) under its Consumer Arbitration Rules, governed by the Federal Arbitration Act. Arbitration may be held remotely or in [County, State]. Either party may instead bring an individual claim in small claims court if it qualifies. Either party may also seek injunctive relief in court to protect intellectual property rights.</p><p><strong>CLASS ACTION WAIVER:</strong> YOU AND LUXE SASSY AGREE THAT CLAIMS MAY BE BROUGHT ONLY ON AN INDIVIDUAL BASIS AND NOT AS A PLAINTIFF OR CLASS MEMBER IN ANY CLASS, CONSOLIDATED, OR REPRESENTATIVE PROCEEDING.</p><h3>15. Termination</h3><p>You may stop using the Site at any time. We may suspend or terminate your account or access to the Site at any time, with or without notice, if we believe you have violated these Terms or acted in a way that harms Luxe Sassy, other customers, or third parties. Provisions that by their nature should survive termination, including payment obligations, disclaimers, limitations of liability, and dispute resolution, will remain in effect.</p><h3>16. General Terms</h3><ul><li><strong>No waiver:</strong> Our failure to enforce any right does not waive that right.</li><li><strong>Severability:</strong> If any provision is found unenforceable, the rest of these Terms remain in effect.</li><li><strong>Entire agreement:</strong> These Terms, together with our Privacy Policy and any policies posted on the Site, are the entire agreement between you and Luxe Sassy regarding the Site and your purchases.</li><li><strong>Assignment:</strong> You may not transfer your rights under these Terms. We may assign ours without restriction.</li><li><strong>Electronic communications:</strong> You agree to receive communications from us electronically, and that these satisfy any legal requirement that communications be in writing.</li></ul><h3>17. Contact Us</h3><p>Questions about these Terms? We're here to help.</p><p><strong>Luxe Sassy</strong><br/>Email: [<a href=\"mailto:support@luxesassy.com\">support@luxesassy.com</a>]<br/><br/>Mailing address: 1627 S Michigan Ave, Villa Park IL 60181, United States</p>",
